    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">văcerra</span></b> , ae,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				log</i>, <i>stock</i>, <i>post.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Col. 9, 1,
			3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 1, 9</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">6, 19,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, like stipes, and our <i>stock</i>, <i>block</i>, as a term of
			abuse applied to a stupid person: vecorde et malefica vacerra, Liy.
			Andron. ap. <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 375</span></i> Müll. (Com.
			Fragm. v. 7 Rib.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
